			"Message": "docs(Worker): Refine service worker documentation and formatting\n\nUpdate the README.md for the Worker element to improve clarity and visual consistency. Modify the emphasis on the authentication challenge to specifically target `Web` applications and align the emoji spacing with the project's PascalCase styling conventions.\n\nThese narrative adjustments better articulate the security and offline-capability value proposition of the Land service worker without altering technical content.",
