				3
			],
			"Message": "style(Worker): Reformat ESBuild configuration files to match PascalCase style\n\nApply consistent tab indentation and vertical spacing to the ESBuild configuration files within the Worker element (`Configuration/ESBuild/Target.js`, `Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.js`, and `Source/Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.js`). The changes align the syntax structure with the project-wide PascalCase and formatting standards without altering any logic or build behavior.\n\nThis ensures uniform readability and maintainability across the build tooling for the editor's web workers.",
